  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1913\">\n<p data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1913\"><strong data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1820\">No aberrant expression detected</strong> / <strong data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1906\">Abnormal blast population detected with immunophenotype consistent with AML/ALL</strong> / etc.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"2048\">\n<p data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"2048\">Immunophenotyping supports diagnosis of: e.g., <strong data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1989\">Acute Myeloid Leukemia</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2000\">ALL-B</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2011\">T-ALL</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2020\">MDS</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2042\">Reactive changes</strong>, etc.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
